<title>CANADA: Bank of Canada monetary index to Jan 22.</title>
<headline>Bank of Canada monetary index to Jan 22.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada released its monetary conditions index:</p>
<p>		    3-month paper	Cdn dollar	Index</p>
<p>Jan 22		 3.11		 86.24	 -4.99</p>
<p>Jan 15		 3.16		 85.52	 -5.22</p>
<p>Jan 8		  3.15		 84.67	 -5.56</p>
<p>Jan 1		  3.15		 83.49	 -6.03</p>
<p>Dec 25		 3.13		 83.80	 -5.93</p>
<p>Dec 18		 3.13		 83.68	 -5.98</p>
<p>Dec 11		 3.22		 83.90	 -5.80</p>
<p>Dec 4		  2.99		 84.64	 -5.74</p>
<p>Nov 27		 2.92		 84.79	 -5.74</p>
<p>Nov 20		 3.01		 84.85	 -5.63</p>
<p>Nov 13		 3.05		 85.49	 -5.34</p>
<p>Nov 6		  3.06		 85.88	 -5.18</p>
<p>Oct 30		 3.30		 85.18	 -5.21</p>
<p>Oct 23		 3.33		 85.07	 -5.23</p>
<p>Oct 16		 3.55		 84.38	 -5.28</p>
<p>NOTE - The index measures the 3-month prime corporate paper rate and the Canadian dollar index against G-10 currencies. Index base is January 1987.</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau (613) 235-6745))</p>
